nOver the years we have built a network of collectors and partners across Europe, which allows us to find even the rarest examples – from limited series to cars with unique Tailor Made specifications.\n\nLooking for a specific model? Get in touch and we will find it for you – discreetly and without obligation.", "imageUrl": "media/img/photo-1583121274602-3e2820c69888.jpg", "publishedAt": "2026-11-10T00:00:00"}, {"id": 2, "category": "Articles", "title": "Investment Cars of the 2000s", "subtitle": "7 models worth watching", "summary": "Seven performance cars from 2000–2010, price trends on the European market and the G-Cars investment perspective.", "content": "Cars from the first decade of the 2000s are at a turning point: old enough to be rare, yet modern enough to enjoy every day.\n\nNaturally aspirated engines, manual gearboxes and an analogue driving feel are increasingly sought after. That is exactly why the value of well-preserved examples keeps rising.\n\nIn this article we present the models we are watching closely, along with tips on what to look out for when buying a collector car.", "imageUrl": "media/img/photo-1567808291548-fc3ee04dbcf0.jpg", "publishedAt": "2026-10-20T00:00:00"}, {"id": 3, "category": "Events", "title": "G-Cars Carspotting Day 2026", "subtitle": null, "summary": "More than 2,000 visitors, hundreds of supercars and an unforgettable atmosphere in front of our showroom.", "content": "Once again this year we organised Carspotting Day in front of the G-Cars showroom. Car enthusiasts from all over the region gathered to see some of the rarest cars in the world.\n\nThank you to all the visitors, partners and owners who brought their cars. See you again next year!", "imageUrl": "media/img/photo-1692406069831-0bb7ea297645.jpg", "publishedAt": "2026-07-14T00:00:00"}]}}